      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This is a small set of 61 diagnostic contrast enhanced CT scans with known tumors.  The images were retrospectively acquired, to ensure sufficient patient follow-up. Slice thickness is variable : between 3 and 6 mm. All images were done at diagnosis and prior to surgery.",
